      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bad1adcbbd32f455",
      "translationZh": "我正在 linux 上通过 llama-server 使用 llama cpp。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d9a7e23ac5c5bca",
      "translationZh": "我的 GPU 是 rx 9060 xt，配有 16 GB 显存，另外我有 16 GB 的 DDR4 内存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29df138a283f4d6e",
      "translationZh": "我有一些模型，比如 Qwen 3.8 27B、Qwen 3.6 35B、gemma 4 26B 等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "137f544b80b74d44",
      "translationZh": "我让这些模型编写 C++ Raylib 应用，但它们从来都写不对。它们似乎只了解截至 Raylib 5.5 的 Raylib API，而 raylib 目前已经是 6.0 版本了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "771ca4198fa8da31",
      "translationZh": "它们似乎还会编造并不存在的 raylib 函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe66229d63ed08be",
      "translationZh": "Raylib 的“所有者”确实分享了一份包含全部 Raylib API 的 pdf，它是一个小型图形 API。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a74206f86bec5689",
      "translationZh": "我在与这些模型聊天时会上传这份 pdf，并要求它们遵循 pdf 中的 API。这会占用挺多上下文，这份文件大约有 80 kb。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3880a0e508e7dd8d",
      "translationZh": "我想知道，能不能让这些模型只获取它们需要的内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
